  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 在這個生存世界裡，你將探索高聳的山巒、深邃的峽谷與蜿蜒的長河。這顯然比一般的原版 Minecraft 生存體驗更出色。你可以將其用於伺服器。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1082089/description_4dfdda8a-0672-4efd-87fd-16df6c1625cc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"405\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 這張地圖提供了原版所沒有的：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 平滑地形</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 農耕用地</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 客製化森林</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 山脈景觀漸層</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 還有<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">更多</span>！！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 這些專案能順利完成，多虧了像您一樣慷慨的贊助者。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 祝遊玩愉快 :)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">也歡迎瀏覽我的其他地圖！</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七座生存島嶼</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘島嶼</a></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">J.M.J.</span></strong></p>",
